{
  "name": "@ss/nextjs",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "next dev",
    "start": "next dev",
    "build": "next build",
    "serve": "next start",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "format": "prettier --write . '!(node_modules|.next|contracts)/**/*'",
    "check-types": "tsc --noEmit --incremental",
    "vercel": "vercel",
    "vercel:yolo": "vercel --build-env NEXT_PUBLIC_IGNORE_BUILD_ERROR=true"
  },
  "//resolutions": [
    "Vercel compila esta carpeta por separado, sin el candado de la raiz, asi que resuelve",
    "las versiones frescas en vez de las que estan probadas aqui. Las versiones nuevas de",
    "@coinbase/cdp-sdk —que entra por el conector de billetera de RainbowKit— importan",
    "@x402/*, paquetes que nadie declara, y la compilacion muere con ocho 'Module not found'.",
    "Esta linea fija la version que el candado de la raiz ya tiene probada. Yarn 3 la ignora",
    "en un paquete hijo, asi que no cambia nada en local: solo actua en el servidor."
  ],
  "resolutions": {
    "@coinbase/cdp-sdk": "1.51.0"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@heroicons/react": "^2.2.0",
    "@rainbow-me/rainbowkit": "2.2.9",
    "@tanstack/react-query": "^5.59.15",
    "blo": "^2.0.0",
    "burner-connector": "0.0.20",
    "daisyui": "^5.5.19",
    "kubo-rpc-client": "^6.1.0",
    "next": "^16.2.4",
    "next-nprogress-bar": "^2.4.7",
    "next-themes": "^0.4.6",
    "qrcode.react": "^4.2.0",
    "react": "^19.2.5",
    "react-dom": "^19.2.5",
    "react-hot-toast": "^2.6.0",
    "usehooks-ts": "^3.1.1",
    "viem": "2.39.0",
    "wagmi": "2.19.5",
    "zustand": "^5.0.12"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@tailwindcss/postcss": "^4.2.4",
    "@trivago/prettier-plugin-sort-imports": "^4.3.0",
    "@types/node": "^24",
    "@types/react": "^19.2.14",
    "abitype": "1.0.6",
    "bgipfs": "^0.0.12",
    "eslint": "^9.39.0",
    "eslint-config-next": "^16.2.4",
    "eslint-config-prettier": "^10.1.8",
    "eslint-plugin-prettier": "^5.5.5",
    "postcss": "^8.5.10",
    "prettier": "^3.8.3",
    "tailwindcss": "^4.2.4",
    "type-fest": "^4.26.1",
    "typescript": "^5.8.2",
    "vercel": "~52.2.1"
  }
}
